dient-gras-double"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gras-double"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":1,"groups":[["Lyonnaise cuisine","cuisine/lyonnaise-cuisine",[["Tablier de sapeur","dish/tablier-de-sapeur"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Tripe","ingredient/tripe"]]}],"img":{"src":"/world-cuisine/img/thumb/f/f1/Trippa2.jpg/500px-Trippa2.jpg","w":500,"h":667,"by":"Lissen","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Trippa2.jpg"}}}